## 13. User Interface Design

User interface design shows how the user will interact with the product.

### UI Design Can Include

```text
wireframes
screen sketches
navigation map
button labels
form fields
error message examples
table layout
menu structure
```

### Good UI Design Should Consider

```text
clear labels
simple navigation
minimal unnecessary steps
readable output
consistent layout
clear error messages
client/user skill level
```

### Example UI Plan

```text
Main Menu
├── Add Record
├── Search Records
├── View Weekly Summary
├── Edit/Delete Record
└── Exit
```

