## 14. Wireframe Example

A wireframe is a simple sketch of a screen.

```text
+--------------------------------------+
| Homework Tracker                     |
+--------------------------------------+
| Student Name: [____________________] |
| Task Name:    [____________________] |
| Due Date:     [____/____/__________] |
| Status:       [Completed v]          |
|                                      |
| [Save Record]   [Clear]   [Back]     |
|                                      |
| Message: __________________________  |
+--------------------------------------+
```

### Explanation

This design supports success criteria related to:

```text
adding records
required fields
clear messages
simple user input
```

